{"seq":2,"slug":"evaluation-debugging","title":"评估调试与策略诊断","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/reinforcement-learning-applied/engineering/evaluation-debugging","wordCount":1660,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"评估调试与策略诊断\">评估调试与策略诊断</h1><p>RL 系统的评估与调试比监督学习困难一个量级——策略的好坏不仅取决于单步预测准确率，还依赖于长期累积行为的质量。一个在训练时 reward 曲线持续上升的策略，部署后可能因为奖励黑客、分布偏移或环境变化而表现灾难。2024-2026 年间，RL 评估已经从&quot;看看 reward 曲线就行&quot;发展为一套包含离线评估、在线实验、安全监控的系统性工程实践。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-rl-评估的多层体系\">核心概念：RL 评估的多层体系</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>评估层次</th>\n<th>时机</th>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>度量</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>训练过程监控</td>\n<td>每 N 步</td>\n<td>曲线追踪 + 统计检测</td>\n<td>reward / KL / entropy / gradient</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>离线策略评估</td>\n<td>部署前</td>\n<td>OPE (IS / FQE / DR)</td>\n<td>预期回报估计</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>静态测试集</td>\n<td>部署前</td>\n<td>固定 prompt/场景集</td>\n<td>准确率 / 人类评分</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>小流量 AB</td>\n<td>部署初期</td>\n<td>随机化对照实验</td>\n<td>业务指标差异</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>生产监控</td>\n<td>持续运行</td>\n<td>实时指标 + 异常检测</td>\n<td>漂移 / 退化 / 安全违反</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph TRAIN[&quot;训练阶段&quot;]&#10;        T1[&quot;Reward 曲线&quot;]&#10;        T2[&quot;KL 散度监控&quot;]&#10;        T3[&quot;梯度健康度&quot;]&#10;        T4[&quot;生成多样性&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph OFFLINE[&quot;离线评估&quot;]&#10;        O1[&quot;OPE 估计&quot;]&#10;        O2[&quot;固定测试集&quot;]&#10;        O3[&quot;人类评估&quot;]&#10;        O4[&quot;安全检查&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph ONLINE[&quot;在线评估&quot;]&#10;        ON1[&quot;AB 实验&quot;]&#10;        ON2[&quot;实时监控&quot;]&#10;        ON3[&quot;异常告警&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    TRAIN --&gt;|&quot;通过训练门控&quot;| OFFLINE&#10;    OFFLINE --&gt;|&quot;通过离线门控&quot;| ONLINE&#10;    ONLINE --&gt;|&quot;发现问题&quot;| TRAIN\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph TRAIN[\"训练阶段\"]\n        T1[\"Reward 曲线\"]\n        T2[\"KL 散度监控\"]\n        T3[\"梯度健康度\"]\n        T4[\"生成多样性\"]\n    end\n    subgraph OFFLINE[\"离线评估\"]\n        O1[\"OPE 估计\"]\n        O2[\"固定测试集\"]\n        O3[\"人类评估\"]\n        O4[\"安全检查\"]\n    end\n    subgraph ONLINE[\"在线评估\"]\n        ON1[\"AB 实验\"]\n        ON2[\"实时监控\"]\n        ON3[\"异常告警\"]\n    end\n    TRAIN --&gt;|\"通过训练门控\"| OFFLINE\n    OFFLINE --&gt;|\"通过离线门控\"| ONLINE\n    ONLINE --&gt;|\"发现问题\"| TRAIN</pre><h2 id=\"训练过程诊断\">训练过程诊断</h2><p>RL 训练中需要监控的核心指标远多于监督学习：</p>\n<p><strong>Reward 相关指标</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Episode reward（滑动平均 + 分位数）：核心性能指标</li>\n<li>Reward 分布的方差：过低 = 策略坍缩；突然升高 = 可能的奖励黑客</li>\n<li>RM score vs KL 的 Pareto 曲线：健康的训练应该是 RM score 适度上升、KL 缓慢增长</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>策略健康度指标</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Entropy：策略分布的熵。持续下降 = entropy collapse（策略过度确定）</li>\n<li>KL(policy || reference)：偏离参考策略的程度。爆炸 = 训练不稳定</li>\n<li>Approx KL：PPO 实际产生的每步 KL（不同于目标 KL），用于检测 clip 是否生效</li>\n<li>Ratio 统计：PPO 重要性采样比率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_t(\\theta)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的分布——大量超出 clip 范围 = 策略跳变</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>梯度与训练稳定性</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Gradient norm：梯度范数突然升高 = 训练不稳定</li>\n<li>Value loss：Critic 的估计误差——持续升高 = Critic 跟不上 Actor 的变化</li>\n<li>Explained variance：Critic 预测的方差与实际回报方差的比值——低于 0 = Critic 完全失效</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>RLHF 专用诊断</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Response length 分布：生成长度的突然变化通常预示奖励黑客</li>\n<li>Diversity 指标（unique n-grams ratio）：快速下降 = 策略坍缩到模板</li>\n<li>Win-rate vs reference（人类评估）：RM score 上升但 win-rate 不升 = RM 被利用</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"奖励黑客检测\">奖励黑客检测</h2><p>奖励黑客是 RLHF 系统最危险的失败模式。检测策略：</p>\n<p><strong>统计信号检测</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>RM score 上升速率异常（超过历史分位数 3 倍）</li>\n<li>KL 散度加速增长（非线性上升）</li>\n<li>生成内容的 n-gram 重复率骤升</li>\n<li>Response 长度与 RM score 的相关系数异常高</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>对抗性验证</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>用独立训练的第二个 RM 交叉验证分数——如果两个 RM 的分数趋势分离，说明策略在利用第一个 RM 的特异性缺陷</li>\n<li>定期采样生成内容做人类评估——RM score 涨但人类评分不涨 = 确认黑客</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>自动化防护</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>设置 KL 硬上限：当 KL 超过阈值时停止训练</li>\n<li>RM score 上限裁剪：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>RM</mtext></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>max</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r = \\min(r_{\\text{RM}}, r_{\\text{max}})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">RM</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">max</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li>多 RM 集成取中位数：消除单个 RM 的可利用偏差</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"离线策略评估-ope\">离线策略评估（OPE）</h2><p>部署 Offline RL 策略之前，OPE 提供了不用上线就能估计策略表现的工具：</p>\n<p><strong>重要性采样（IS）方法</strong>：</p>\n<p>Per-Decision IS (PDIS)：逐步计算重要性权重，避免整条轨迹的乘积爆炸：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>V</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mtext>PDIS</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>N</mi></mfrac><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></munderover><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mi>T</mi></munderover><msup><mi>γ</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><msubsup><mi>ρ</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>:</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mi>ρ</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>:</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∏</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mi>t</mi></munderover><mfrac><mrow><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>∣</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>β</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>∣</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{V}_{\\text{PDIS}} = \\frac{1}{N} \\sum_{i=1}^N \\sum_{t=0}^T \\gamma^t \\rho_{0:t}^{(i)} r_t^{(i)}, \\quad \\rho_{0:t} = \\prod_{k=0}^t \\frac{\\pi(a_k \\mid s_k)}{\\pi_\\beta(a_k \\mid s_k)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0968em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">PDIS</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.106em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8283em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8283em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8829em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span