g reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2198em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2458em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">:</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.0827em;vertical-align:-1.3021em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.7806em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∏</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3021em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>Weighted IS (WIS)：用归一化权重降低方差，但引入少量偏差。</p>\n<p><strong>直接方法（DM）</strong>：训练一个 Q 函数逼近目标策略的价值，然后用初始状态分布估计期望回报。FQE（Fitted Q Evaluation）是最常用的实现。</p>\n<p><strong>双重鲁棒（DR）</strong>：结合 IS 和 DM 的优势——当模型估计不准时退回 IS 的无偏性，当 IS 方差大时利用模型降方差。</p>\n<p><strong>OPE 实践建议</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>不要只看单个 OPE 估计——同时运行 IS、WIS、FQE、DR，观察它们的一致性</li>\n<li>如果多个估计器给出矛盾结论，说明数据覆盖不足，OPE 不可靠</li>\n<li>OPE 只是决策参考——最终仍需 AB 实验验证</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"在线-ab-实验设计\">在线 AB 实验设计</h2><p>RL 策略的 AB 实验与传统 ML 模型有显著差异：</p>\n<p><strong>长期效应评估</strong>：RL 优化长期回报，因此 AB 实验需要更长的观测窗口。推荐系统的 RL 策略通常需要 2-4 周才能充分展示长期效益。</p>\n<p><strong>溢出效应（Spillover）</strong>：在社交网络/推荐场景中，实验组和对照组的用户可能相互影响（如内容传播）。需要集群随机化或网络 AB 设计。</p>\n<p><strong>安全约束监控</strong>：实验期间持续监控安全指标——如果 RL 策略导致用户投诉率、内容违规率等超过阈值，自动触发熔断回滚。</p>\n<p><strong>渐进式放量</strong>：1% → 5% → 20% → 50% → 100% 的分阶段放量，每阶段确认安全性和效果后再扩大。</p>\n<h2 id=\"可解释性与策略诊断\">可解释性与策略诊断</h2><p>RL 策略的可解释性对于建立部署信心至关重要：</p>\n<p><strong>注意力可视化</strong>：对于基于 Transformer 的策略，可视化注意力权重揭示策略关注的输入维度。</p>\n<p><strong>SHAP / 特征重要性</strong>：对 Q 函数做特征归因，理解哪些状态特征驱动了决策。</p>\n<p><strong>反事实分析</strong>：改变状态中的某个特征，观察策略决策的变化——验证策略是否依赖了合理的特征。</p>\n<p><strong>策略行为聚类</strong>：将策略在不同状态下的行为聚类，识别策略学到的&quot;决策模式&quot;。如果某个模式覆盖了不合理的状态集合，可能预示泛化问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>RL 评估是多层体系：训练监控 → 离线评估 → AB 实验 → 生产监控</li>\n<li>奖励黑客检测需要多维度统计信号 + 对抗性验证 + 自动化防护</li>\n<li>OPE 方法（IS/FQE/DR）提供部署前的策略价值估计，但需多方法交叉验证</li>\n<li>AB 实验需要更长观测窗口、安全熔断机制和渐进式放量</li>\n<li>可解释性工具（注意力/SHAP/反事实）是建立部署信心的关键手段</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同章深入：<a href=\"production-deployment\">生产部署</a>介绍策略通过评估门控后的上线与持续监控实践</li>\n<li>跨库参考：<a href=\"../../llm-fine-tuning/evaluation/evaluation-metrics\">LLM 微调评估指标</a>展示了 LLM 对齐效果评估的度量体系</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"评估调试与策略诊断","id":"评估调试与策略诊断"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：RL 评估的多层体系","id":"核心概念-rl-评估的多层体系"},{"level":2,"text":"训练过程诊断","id":"训练过程诊断"},{"level":2,"text":"奖励黑客检测","id":"奖励黑客检测"},{"level":2,"text":"离线策略评估（OPE）","id":"离线策略评估-ope"},{"level":2,"text":"在线 AB 实验设计","id":"在线-ab-实验设计"},{"level":2,"text":"可解释性与策略诊断","id":"可解释性与策略诊断"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"训练基础设施与分布式系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/reinforcement-learning-applied/engineering/training-infrastructure"},"next":{"title":"生产部署与在线服务","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/reinforcement-learning-applied/engineering/production-deployment"}}